{
 "fps": 30,
 "frames": 1170,
 "duration": 39.0,
 "captions": [
  {
   "text": "If you pressed these pads",
   "emph": [
    "pads"
   ],
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 1.11,
   "show": 0,
   "hide": 1.07
  },
  {
   "text": "against a glass wall,",
   "emph": [
    "glass"
   ],
   "start": 1.11,
   "end": 2.35,
   "show": 1.07,
   "hide": 2.31
  },
  {
   "text": "you could lift your feet",
   "emph": [
    "lift",
    "feet"
   ],
   "start": 2.35,
   "end": 3.22,
   "show": 2.31,
   "hide": 3.18
  },
  {
   "text": "off the ground\u2014",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 3.22,
   "end": 3.83,
   "show": 3.18,
   "hide": 4.12
  },
  {
   "text": "and climb it like Spider-Man.",
   "emph": [
    "spiderman"
   ],
   "start": 4.16,
   "end": 5.72,
   "show": 4.12,
   "hide": 6.08
  },
  {
   "text": "Their surfaces are covered",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 6.12,
   "end": 7.45,
   "show": 6.08,
   "hide": 7.41
  },
  {
   "text": "in microscopic wedges.",
   "emph": [
    "microscopic",
    "wedges"
   ],
   "start": 7.45,
   "end": 8.75,
   "show": 7.41,
   "hide": 9.11
  },
  {
   "text": "As you pull downward,",
   "emph": [
    "downward"
   ],
   "start": 9.15,
   "end": 10.15,
   "show": 9.11,
   "hide": 10.29
  },
  {
   "text": "the wedges bend flat",
   "emph": [
    "flat"
   ],
   "start": 10.33,
   "end": 11.39,
   "show": 10.29,
   "hide": 11.35
  },
  {
   "text": "against the glass.",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 11.39,
   "end": 12.2,
   "show": 11.35,
   "hide": 12.64
  },
  {
   "text": "This brings them so close",
   "emph": [
    "close"
   ],
   "start": 12.68,
   "end": 14.07,
   "show": 12.64,
   "hide": 14.05
  },
  {
   "text": "that tiny molecular attractions",
   "emph": [
    "molecular"
   ],
   "start": 14.09,
   "end": 15.82,
   "show": 14.05,
   "hide": 15.78
  },
  {
   "text": "can hold your entire weight.",
   "emph": [
    "entire",
    "weight"
   ],
   "start": 15.82,
   "end": 17.2,
   "show": 15.78,
   "hide": 17.61
  },
  {
   "text": "Special springs spread the load,",
   "emph": [
    "springs"
   ],
   "start": 17.65,
   "end": 19.19,
   "show": 17.61,
   "hide": 19.32
  },
  {
   "text": "so one little patch",
   "emph": [
    "patch"
   ],
   "start": 19.36,
   "end": 20.36,
   "show": 19.32,
   "hide": 20.35
  },
  {
   "text": "doesn\u2019t have to hold you up alone.",
   "emph": [
    "alone"
   ],
   "start": 20.39,
   "end": 21.75,
   "show": 20.35,
   "hide": 22.15
  },
  {
   "text": "Then, you shift your weight",
   "emph": [
    "shift"
   ],
   "start": 22.19,
   "end": 23.5,
   "show": 22.15,
   "hide": 23.46
  },
  {
   "text": "onto the other pad.",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 23.5,
   "end": 24.49,
   "show": 23.46,
   "hide": 24.87
  },
  {
   "text": "The first releases,",
   "emph": [
    "releases"
   ],
   "start": 24.91,
   "end": 25.89,
   "show": 24.87,
   "hide": 26.06
  },
  {
   "text": "letting you reach",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 26.1,
   "end": 26.64,
   "show": 26.06,
   "hide": 26.6
  },
  {
   "text": "higher and repeat.",
   "emph": [
    "higher"
   ],
   "start": 26.64,
   "end": 28.36,
   "show": 26.6,
   "hide": 28.57
  },
  {
   "text": "But there\u2019s a catch.",
   "emph": [
    "catch"
   ],
   "start": 28.61,
   "end": 29.44,
   "show": 28.57,
   "hide": 29.8
  },
  {
   "text": "They need a smooth surface",
   "emph": [
    "smooth"
   ],
   "start": 29.84,
   "end": 31.03,
   "show": 29.8,
   "hide": 30.99
  },
  {
   "text": "to grip.",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 31.03,
   "end": 31.46,
   "show": 30.99,
   "hide": 31.8
  },
  {
   "text": "So you can climb glass\u2014",
   "emph": [
    "glass"
   ],
   "start": 31.84,
   "end": 33.09,
   "show": 31.8,
   "hide": 33.34
  },
  {
   "text": "but switch to rough brick,",
   "emph": [
    "rough",
    "brick"
   ],
   "start": 33.38,
   "end": 34.53,
   "show": 33.34,
   "hide": 34.7
  },
  {
   "text": "and those microscopic wedges",
   "emph": [],
   "start": 34.74,
   "end": 36.11,
   "show": 34.7,
   "hide": 36.08
  },
  {
   "text": "can\u2019t make the same contact.",
   "emph": [
    "contact"
   ],
   "start": 36.12,
   "end": 37.51,
   "show": 36.08,
   "hide": 37.86
  }
 ],
